WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.850
Lily answers Ryu’s recorded Drive Impact.

2
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.550
The counter Drive Impact wins the armor exchange.

3
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.150
Jumping heavy kick picks up the crumple before Lily lands.

4
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:05.700
Lily jumps again and hits with jumping medium punch.

5
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:06.650
The first enhanced OD Condor Dive carries the airborne juggle.

6
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:07.600
A second enhanced OD Condor Dive completes the route.

7
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.800
Ryu remains down after the second Dive.
